	(text_box "DATA ×6 v1.0 — USB2517I hub (7 ports, 6 used), six USB-C each with a TPS2553-1, an INA226 and ESD, a\n  TCA9535 for their EN and FAULT_N, an AP2114H 3.3 V; two LMR51625 make all its 5 V from VIN (20 V,\n  J1.8, switched by the node).  No pin header: the porte-revues bays' boards take no Dupont lead (the\n  DATA ×4 v2 keeps the logic).  One face assembled.\nLead pinout here: 1 NC · 2 SCL · 3 SDA · 4 GND · 5 D− · 6 D+ · 7 GND · 8 VIN — the DATA ×4 v2's lead.\nI²C: TCA9535 0x20, INA226 0x41 / 0x43 / 0x44 / 0x45 / 0x47 / 0x4C; the node's 0x40.\nRails: VIN 20 V (13.5–28 V; on above 13.5 V), ≤ 1.2 A at 20 V · +5V_A / +5V_B 5.24 V, ≤ 1.86 A / 2.32 A\n  (ports 1–3 / 4–6 at the 0.62 A limit, +5V_B with the 3.3 V LDO's 0.46 A) ·\n  PORTn_VBUS 5.1–5.24 V, 0.50–0.62 A limit ·\n  +3V3 3.3 V (AP2114H), ≤ 0.5 A (the hub 0.42 A at most) · HUB_1V8 / HUB_1V8PLL 1.8 V (the hub's own\n  regulators)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 186.69 0)
		(size 534 30.48)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "df95bd5e-7446-5b2d-949d-326a17dcaf98")
	)
